<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no"
    />
    <meta name="description" content="{{ description }}" />
    <meta name="author" content="{{ author }}" />
     
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Source+Sans+Pro:300,400,600"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <script
      type="text/javascript"
      charset="UTF-8"
      src="http://www.joshuarte.it/cookie.js"
    ></script>
    <!-- End Open Graph Protocol -->
    <title>{{title}}</title>

    <!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - Google Analytics -->
    <script
      async
      src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-118732914-2"
    ></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];

      function gtag() {
        dataLayer.push(arguments);
      }
      gtag("js", new Date());

      gtag("config", "UA-118732914-2");
    </script>

    <!-- Generate using http://realfavicongenerator.net/ -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="60x60" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json" />
    <link rel="mask-icon" href="/safari-pinned-tab.svg" color="#5bbad5" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />

    <script
      async
      src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-7716592172266156"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
    ></script>

    <style>
      /* Font & Background */
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap");

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        background: url("/images/mnm/bg.webp") repeat;
        background-color: pink;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        height: 100vh;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      /* Profile Section */
      .profile {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .profile img {
        width: 120px;
        height: 120px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 2px solid #ddd;
      }

      .profile h1 {
        margin: 5px 0;
        font-size: 1.5em;
        color: white;
      }

      .profile p {
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: white;
      }

      /* Links Section */
      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 400px;
      }

      .links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        background-color: #4caf50;
        color: white;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1em;
        transition: background-color 0.3s;
      }

      .links a:hover {
        background-color: #45a049;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="profile">
      <img src="/images/mnm/avatar.jpg" alt="Profile Picture" />
      <h1>MOSCANELLAMMERDA</h1>
      <p>
        Lo sai che la mia mosca si nutre di idee? (oltre che dimmerda!).
        Supportami, condividi le vignette e segui la moscanellammerda per non
        perderti i suoi contenuti!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
